        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 5. Schedules for the week shall be posted by 5:00 p. m. Friday of the week preceding. Except in the case of emergency (such as an Act of God) or employee absence, any change from posted work schedules shall be compensated at time and one-half unless the employee is notified of the change by 5:00 p. m. Friday of the week preceding the change, however, there shall be no restriction or premium compensation involved where additions are made to the schedule.",
